            "CREATE RIP 4 ALLOT  10 RIP C!  0 RIP 1+ C!  0 RIP 2 + C!  1 RIP 3 + C!",
            "RIP 0 TCB-N TCB.REMOTE-IP 4 CMOVE",
            "8080 80 RIP TCB-FIND 0<> .",
